From 9c3d2888e36611daea6f02720cf79d3c440350bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:39:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): keep decimal points in Fanuc-family feed words

Keep explicit decimal points in Fanuc, Doosan DNM and Mazak feeds.
Keep them in the separate capped rotary paths too.
Record the control manual audit and regenerate only affected NC feeds.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3690
